\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Argentina \highlight\uc2  stocks inch up, peso even on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 August 2005\par 22:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Aug 10 (Reuters) - Argentine stocks made small gains on Wednesday as investors traded in blue-chip shares in anticipation of the options expiry next week, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 The benchmark MerVal <.MERV> index of 11 leading stocks inched up 0.34 percent to close at 1509.23 and has risen nearly 10 percent so far this year.  \par \par \uc2 Trade volume was moderate at 77 million pesos ($27 million).  \par \par \uc2 "Despite drops abroad the MerVal held up, especially with trade in Petrobras and Grupo Galicia," said Guido Macchi trader at Macchi, Julio brokerage.  \par \par \uc2 "We are in a period of options and these are exactly the shares that define the market," he said.  \par \par \uc2 Grupo Financiero Galicia , accounting for a quarter of the index, finished even at 2.45 pesos, while Petrobras gained 1 percent to 3.89 pesos.  \par \par \uc2 In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the peso <ARSB=> remained stable at 2.8575/2.86 per dollar as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stem a further appreciation of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The peso has gained 4 percent against the dollar so far this year, and the government expressed concern about a loss of competitiveness for the export sector.  \par \par \uc2 "We are worried about the dollar falling because we want Argentina to remain competitive," Cabinet Chief Alberto Fernandez told a conference on Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-ARGENTINA|LANGEN|ABN|D|M|E|RBN|RNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050810e18a002h2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
