\par\par \b \uc2 Argentine stocks fall,  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  reigns in peso  \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 August 2005\par 00:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, Argentina, Aug 3 (Reuters) - Argentine stocks dipped on Wednesday, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  made a record dollar purchase to stem a further appreciation of the peso.  \par \par \uc2 The benchmark MerVal index <.MERV> of 11 leading stocks fell 1.77 percent to 1,508.23, ending two days of gains that totaled nearly 2 percent.  \par \par \uc2 Trade volume was a robust 84.2 million pesos ($29.5 million).  \par \par \uc2 Traders said the Merval sagged in tandem with a drop in Argentina's inflation-indexed bonds, which slipped after the government's announcement that consumer prices rose 1 percent in July. The figure was lower than some projections of a 1.2 price increase.  \par \par \uc2 "There was a lot of profit-taking with the recent climb in the market and (investors) were looking for any reason to sell. The drop in bond prices carried over to the market," said Nestor DeCesare of Allaria Ledesma brokerage.  \par \par \uc2 Among the losers were steelmaker Acindar , which fell 2.94 percent to 5.28 pesos. BBVA Banco Frances also slumped 2.68 percent to 6.54 pesos.  \par \par \uc2 In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the peso <ARSB=> weakened slightly, to 2,85/2,8525 per dollar after hitting a 15-month high on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 Aiming to keep the peso weak to benefits exports, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has made daily purchases of dollars in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to partially offset dollars pouring in from exporters.  \par \par \uc2 Wednesday's record purchase of $172.4 million by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  beat a $160 million \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on June 22.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 ARGENTINA\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|U|D|M|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050803e183002ha\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
