\par\par \b \uc2 Argentina stocks gain further on U.S. debt ruling  \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Mai 2005\par 22:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES, Argentina, May 16 (Reuters) - Argentine stocks continued to rack up gains on Monday after a U.S. court decision to lift a freeze on Argentine bonds that was blocking the country's crucial debt swap, traders said.  \par \par \uc2 The MerVal index <.MERV> finished 1.28 percent higher at 1,458.18 points, putting the gain so far this year at 6 percent. Volume was high at 91 million pesos ($31 million).  \par \par \uc2 "The market is in a buying mood but is still cautious because the swap hasn't taken place yet," said Leopoldo Olivari of Bacque brokerage. "Once it does, the market will become more solid."  \par \par \uc2 A New York federal appeals court on Friday lifted an embargo by holdout creditors on $7 billion in Argentine bonds involved in the debt swap, originally scheduled for April 1.  \par \par \uc2 The government is expected to proceed with the swap this week.  \par \par \uc2 Among the biggest gainers was Grupo Financiero Galicia , the index leader with 25 percent of the weighting. It rose 3.5 percent to 2.40 pesos.  \par \par \uc2 In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the peso <ARSB=> gained 0.17 percent to close at 2.8875/2.8925 per dollar as the U.S. court decision helped the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 To thwart the peso's rise, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent $101.5 million buying dollars -- the most spent in a daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  so far this year.  \par \par \uc2 MARKETS-\b \highlight22\uc2 ARGENTINA\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|U|RNP|DNP  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050516e15g0027v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
