\par\par \b \uc2 Argentina Ctrl Bk Buys Yr-High $85M;Peso Flat;Bonds Mixed  \b0\par\par\uc2 438 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Mai 2005\par 22:39\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES (Dow Jones)--The Argentine peso ended flat on the day Thursday, but it took a year-high $85.2 million in dollar buying by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to hold the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  steady.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, locally traded Argentine bonds were mixed, with more gainers than losers on continued optimism a day after the government announced lower-than-expected inflation data for April.  \par \par \uc2 The peso closed at ARS2.8975 for the third straight day.  \par \par \uc2 "There was a lot of dollar selling by exporters and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and (state-run) Banco de la Nacion steadily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said trader Carlos Lizer at Puente Hermanos. Exporters and the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  are the two main players in \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's illiquid peso market.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday marked its biggest dollar buy since it purchased $100 million on Dec. 30, 2004.  \par \par \uc2 Lizer said he expects volume to stay strong because exporter repatriations of overseas dollar earnings will remain heavy in the near term with the year's main harvest season is at its peak. Thursday exporter repatriation data was to be released later in the day.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is going to continue to buy dollars to keep the peso near ARS2.90. The exchange rate may vary some, but not much," he said. The government has said it wants a competitive exchange rate that favors Argentine exports.  \par \par \uc2 In the bond market, "it was a mostly positive session," said fixed-income analyst Diego Zavaleta at Besfamille Sociedad de Bolsa.  \par \par \uc2 Among gainers, the dollar-denominated Boden 2013 was last quoted at ARS217, up a peso on the day, while the Bocon Pro 12, a peso note, was up at ARS141.4 from ARS141. Among sliding peso notes, the Boden 2008 was at ARS115.29, down from ARS115.5, while the Bogar 2018 was down at ARS123.75 from ARS124.  \par \par \uc2 Zavaleta described volume, wich was at ARS220 million, as solid. "Yesterday's inflation data helped the market today," he said.  \par \par \uc2 The government announced Wednesday that the consumer price index rose 0.5% in April from March and was up 8.8% on the year. That followed a 1.5% increase in March, when the year-on-year inflation rate of 9.1% sparked concerns that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could hit its full-year target ceiling of 8.0%.  \par \par \uc2 April's month-on-month figure came in under the 0.8% median forecast from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's most recent weekly survey of economists.  \par \par \uc2 -By Drew Benson, Dow Jones Newswires; 5411-4311-3127; andrew.benson@dowjones.com [ 05-05-05 2039GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050505e155000t0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
