\par\par \b \uc2 Argentina Peso Weakens, Ending 3-day Rally; Bonds Mixed  \b0\par\par\uc2 534 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 April 2005\par 21:58\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 BUENOS AIRES (Dow Jones)--Steady \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and state-run Banco de la Nacion managed to slightly weaken the peso Friday, putting an end to a three-day rally for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, activity in the bond market remained low a week after the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange delivered a blow to market confidence by canceling \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its gray market for restructured debt to be issued in the nation's now-delayed swap settlement.  \par \par \uc2 The peso closed at ARS2.895, slightly weaker from ARS2.8925 on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was busy (buying dollars) from the very start of today's session," said trader Hector Blanco with local ABC Mercado de Cambio. "And the Banco de la Nacion was much more active than the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."  \par \par \uc2 Banco de la Nacion has been busy this year buying dollars to help the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hold the peso steady near ARS2.90 against the dollar, traders say.  \par \par \uc2 The help comes as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has set tighter monetary policy goals this year and is now grappling with the rising specter of inflation. The government reported Tuesday that the consumer price index rose in March by an unexpectedly high 1.5% on the month.  \par \par \uc2 Volume in the local exchange market was down by nearly a third, Blanco said, noting that cereal exporters - the other main players in the market besides the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  - appeared to repatriate less overseas dollar earnings than on Thursday. [ 08-04-05 1958GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 In the local bond market, "it was a very boring day," according to fixed income analyst Adolfo Zuberbuhler with Banco Finansur.  \par \par \uc2 The peso-denominated Boden 2008 and Bocon Pre 8 saw the most volume, with interest coming from hedge funds looking for short-term gains, he said.  \par \par \uc2 As such, both notes were up on the day. The Boden 2008 was quoted at ARS114.4, up from ARS114.3, while the Bocon Pre 8 was at ARS160.1 from ARS159.6. Among losers, the Boden 2012 was down to ARS244 from ARS245.03.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, activity in the gray market remained stagnant, Zuberbuhler said.  \par \par \uc2 Gray market trading had taken place in both the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange and the Open Electronic Market. But when a lawsuit by holdout creditors led the government to delay the debt swap settlement beyond the April 1 target date, the stock market canceled all of its transactions.  \par \par \uc2 On Friday, Argentina's two leading private bank associations asked the regulatory authority that oversees the stock exchange to reverse last week's gray market decision. The cancellation came as a blow to investors, many of whom had bought in the stock market to sell in the Open Electronic Market, or vice versa.  \par \par \uc2 "There hasn't been any legal action taken yet," said Zuberbuhler. "They just filed an official statement."  \par \par \uc2 Asked if he thought the stock exchange would restore its gray market, the trader said he doubted it.  \par \par \uc2 "There are some investors and analysts out there who think it is a possibility, but I don't," he said.  \par \par \uc2 -By Drew Benson, Dow Jones Newswires; 5411-4311-3127; andrew.benson@dowjones.com [ 08-04-05 2014GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050408e1480013a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
