\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Argentina \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bank Tuesday  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Totaled $36 Mln \b0\par\par\uc2 220 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2002\par 01:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUENOS AIRES -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday sold $26 million worth of greenbacks and bought $10 million, for a net \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of $16 million, the bank said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  The bank said the session's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading totaled between $400 million and $450 million, in-line with traders'  and analysts' daily estimates since the peso began to float  against the dollar on Feb. 11. \par \par \uc2  The bank said its dollar sales and more from the nation's exporters caused the peso to strengthen. The peso rose to about US$ 0.37 on Tuesday from a post-devaluation low of US$ 0.32 on Monday and Friday. \par \par \uc2  On Monday and again Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars at below-market rates through more than a dozen government-run and private commercial banks. \par \par \uc2  Fearing stiff penalties under Argentine criminal law, exporters and banks are abiding by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  orders demanding that they convert almost all their dollars into pesos much more quickly than they had before the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  began to float against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , anxious to keep a lid on consumer prices, is using a combination of dollar sales and regulations to bolster the peso. \par \par \uc2  -By Tim Loughran, Dow Jones Newswires; 5411-4313-1918; argentina@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020327dy3r0003s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
