\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Argentina \highlight\uc2 's Peso Ends Stronger On Various  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 468 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2002\par 21:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUENOS AIRES -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso (ARS) closed stronger Friday on \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rules requiring banks to dump dollars, as well as a small amount of dollar sales by the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Commercial banks quoted the peso closing at a midrate of  around ARS2.323/dollar for interbank transactions. On Thursday the peso closed at around ARS2.39/dollar for such transactions. \par \par \uc2  A resolution issued late Thursday by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  ordered banks to limit their holdings in dollars to just 5% of what they held on Nov. 30. The resolution ordered banks to sell off their excess dollars by the close of business Friday. \par \par \uc2  Yet in what many say has become the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's characteristic mode of \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday sent banks a communique altering the earlier order. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  now says commercial banks can keep at least  $1 million or 5% of what they held on Nov. 30, whichever sum amounts to less. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also expanded the measure to include all accounts the bank holds overseas and all liquid investments abroad. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resolution is just one of many desperate measures to prop up the peso, which has plunged by as much as 60% since it was devalued and began to  float in early January. \par \par \uc2  "These are strong measures coming at a difficult time for Argentina," said Rafael Ber, an analyst at Argentine Research Consultancy. Ber characterized the measures forcing  banks to sell off large parts of their dollar positions as "a way to control the market, without using (\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) reserves." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have been dwindling steadily since  the government scrapped the country's 11-year \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board, which pegged the peso 1:1 to the U.S. dollar. On Friday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported that net foreign reserves had dropped $60 million in a day to $13.54 billion, as of March 13. \par \par \uc2  For the most part the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been carried out through almost-daily dollar sales, traders say. In the days after the peso began to float freely on January 11, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would sell around $25 million to $50 million per session, traders said. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at its highest levels since the January devaluation, selling anywhere from $135 million to $150 million Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Though traders couldn't provide a figure for Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  they said it appeared to be more along the lines of the less severe earlier \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and was nowhere near as high as Thursday's action. \par \par \uc2  As a matter of policy the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't comment on its market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -By Dawn Weiner, Dow Jones Newswires; 5411-4311-3127; \b \highlight22\uc2 argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 @dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020020315dy3f0015k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
