\par\par \b \uc2  Argentine stocks up, Cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in peso mkt. \b0\par\par\uc2 194 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2002\par 16:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      BUENOS AIRES, \b \highlight22\uc2 Argentina\b0 \highlight\uc2 , March 14 (Reuters) - Argentine \par \par \uc2  stocks traded higher on Thursday as the peso firmed slightly \par \par \uc2  against the dollar following \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  after \par \par \uc2  Tuesday's historic lows, traders said. \par \par \uc2      The leading MerVal share index, which has gained over a \par \par \uc2  third this year, was up 0.28 percent to 404.19 points at 12:41 \par \par \uc2  p.m. (1541 GMT). Volume was low with some 2.4 million pesos \par \par \uc2  worth of shares changing hands. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , keen to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from weakening \par \par \uc2  further, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the third consecutive session by \par \par \uc2  dollars at around 2.325 pesos per dollar on Thursday. \par \par \uc2      The peso was slightly firmer at 2.39/2.41 (buy/sell rate) \par \par \uc2  at Thursday's midsession from Wednesday's close of 2.40/2.42 \par \par \uc2  after hitting a record low of 2.41/2.43 on Tuesday ARSB=). \par \par \uc2      The peso has lost about 58 percent against the dollar since \par \par \uc2  its January devaluation. \par \par \uc2      Grupo Financiero Galicia's stocks traded unchanged at 43 \par \par \uc2  centavos as traders awaited news on a proposed bailout deal \par \par \uc2  that would inject desperately needed cash into the cash-starved \par \par \uc2  Banco Galicia. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020314dy3e00v2k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\